    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>In Six-Fours-les-Plages, Laverie La Baleine hosts a Dogwash station operated by Speed Laverie: a self-service dog washing system installed next to the regular washing machines, on avenue de Lattre de Tassigny. It works the same way as the other Dogwash network stations found across the Var: you wash and dry your dog yourself in about ten minutes.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>24/7 opening is confirmed by the Var departmental tourist board (an institutional source) in addition to business listings. The price is now confirmed: €10 for the first 10 minutes, then €2 per additional 2-minute block — the same pricing as the Hyères harbour dogwash, run by the same provider (Speed Laverie). The exact products supplied (type of shampoo) are not specified in the sources found.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: since it's primarily a launderette, bring change or a suitable means of payment — the exact payment terms for the dog wash aren't detailed in the information available.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Six-Fours-les-Plages and its many beaches (Bonnegrâce, Le Brusc) are just a stone's throw away — handy for rinsing off your dog right after a swim.</p>
